 ## Evaluation
 
 EAU is evaluated on UserGym, ColBench, and tau2-bench with Qwen3-4B and Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct policy backbones. The reported Qwen3-4B results include 0.623 on UserGym, 0.600 ColBench task success, and 0.627 overall.
+
+## Research context
+
+EAU contributes to agent-environment-user co-evolution for LLM agents. It targets multi-turn reinforcement learning with simulated users and tools, and treats the adaptive training system as editable rather than fixed. The environment, agent training process, and user simulator are jointly revised from training feedback. See https://eau-meta-agent.github.io/research-context.html for scope and comparisons.
